    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 14,
      "title": {
        "en": "Helpful clerks alongside staffing shortages"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many visitors praise individual store associates, fish specialists, and stylist Ruby for their friendly guidance and attentive service when helping with pet food or grooming needs. In contrast, several shoppers report frustrating encounters with sole cashiers managing busy checkout lines, unresponsive management, and delays when requesting assistance in the aquatics department."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Spacious layout with self-wash station"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers appreciate the store's clean aisles, cool air conditioning, and broad inventory for cats, dogs, and aquatic animals. Multiple customers highlight the convenient self-service dog wash area available for twenty dollars and extended evening shopping hours compared to neighboring stores, though one reviewer noted occasional limited inventory on certain items."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Healthy aquarium fish and grooming"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients report healthy aquatic fish and live plants that thrive after purchase, along with successful grooming appointments for large double-coated dogs like Huskies. Pet parents commend stylists who work gently with pets. However, one client experienced an unsatisfactory groom where coat length was shaved completely instead of trimmed to the owner's specifications."
      }
    }
  ],
